  "seoTitle": "Marc Marquez Wins 2026 MotoGP World Title",
  "metaDescription": "Ducati rider Marc Marquez has officially clinched the 2026 MotoGP world championship title after an eighth-place finish at the Portuguese Grand Prix.",
